BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Muppet Christmas Carol (1992)
DTSTART:20251212T023000Z
DTEND:20251212T041500Z
DTSTAMP:20251212T023000Z
UID:27MJhRYPnJ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 89 mins (1h29m)\n\nSIFF Holiday Favorites Charles Di
 ckens’ timeless tale of Ebenezer Scrooge (Michael Caine)\, his cold hear
 t\, and how the Ghosts of Christmas Past\, Present\, and Future seek to sh
 ow him the error of his ways comes to life through the magic of Jim Henson
 ’s Muppets. Recently remastered\, including the original song "When Love
  is Gone." Arrive 30 minutes early for an exciting Muppet pre-show special
 ! All ages welcome ($5 tickets for children aged 2-12 years old\, free for
  under 2).\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/holiday-favorites/t
 he-muppet-christmas-carol\n\nEstimated start: 18:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
